# x7_param_defer: parameters materialised only when no other node is computable. Borrowed.
#
# donor      SHAFT-GPU s4_param_defer: VRAM 1,071,104 -> 362,496 kB (-66.2%), three runs byte-identical,
#            transcript 11,229,212,672 bytes / 1526 rounds.
# mechanism  five lines in _find_computable_node. Parameter nodes have no inputs (all([]) is True) and
#            ONNX initializers come first, so all 201 shares are read back from disk before any operator.
# transfer   possibly null here: whole-model peak is the ONNX conversion; this arm's peak is a 765 MB
#            embedding-forward transient (x5_graph_clear +0.10%, x6_embed_stream null). Three runs, ~108 s.
# gate       expected to change (operator order, mask stream); phase B via the transcript.
# streaming  driver and loader as x4_stream_load.env.
SHAFT_SCRIPT=$BASE/bert_perlayer_stream_cpu.py
SHAFT_LEVERS=plaintext_free_cpu,triple_share_free_cpu,trace_nograd_cpu,onnx_single_file_export_cpu,encrypt_spill_cpu,embed_chunk_cpu,param_defer_cpu
SHAFT_INNER_ENV="SHAFT_EMBED_CHUNKS=16"
